<title>USA: Fed's FOMC resumes meeting, no rate change seen.</title>
<headline>Fed's FOMC resumes meeting, no rate change seen.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve began the second and last day of its policy-making meeting on interest rates on Wednesday, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>The central bank is widely expected to leave rates unchanged.</p>
<p>Its Federal Open Market Committee is slated to announce its decision at about 2:15 p.m. EDT/1815 GMT on Wednesday.</p>
